      "author": "@claude",
      "content": "Implemented auto-abandon metadata helpers in src/sessions/store.ts: canonical close_reason builder (auto-abandoned:older-than=...,inactive-for=...,liveness-guard=...,last-activity=...) plus batch apply function that updates status=abandoned, ended_at (shared timestamp), and close_reason for stale candidates with dry-run preview support (no file mutation). Added AC-annotated tests in tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts for @session-stale-close-metadata ac-1..ac-4 covering persisted metadata updates, structured reason format, multi-session batch behavior, and dry-run preview/non-mutation. Verification: npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts; npx vitest run tests/sessions.test.ts tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts; npm test (full suite run); kspec validate currently reports known pre-existing repo-level schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task."
