      "author": "@claude",
      "content": "Implemented stale-session criteria engine in src/sessions/store.ts: relative-duration validation/defaults (older-than=24h, inactive-for=6h, liveness-guard=5m), strict activity resolution with started_at fallback for missing events, AND-based threshold evaluation, and liveness-guard suppression for recently-active sessions. Added AC-annotated regression coverage in tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts for @session-stale-criteria ac-1..ac-8, including corrupt events handling and absolute timestamp rejection guidance. Verification: npx vitest run tests/session-stale-criteria.test.ts tests/sessions.test.ts; npm test (full suite pass: 3578 passed, 3 skipped). kspec validate currently reports known pre-existing repo-level schema/reference/alignment/completeness issues unrelated to this task."
